  data: {
    LLM: "Eight contracts played in sequence: 1. **No Tricks**: Avoid winning any tricks. 2. **No Hearts**: Avoid capturing Heart cards. 3. **No Red King (FelsÃ¶)**: Avoid the King of Hearts (The 'Old Man'). 4. **No Last Trick**: Avoid the 8th trick of the round. 5. **Suta (The Train)**: Players must shed cards by building sequences. First to finish wins. 6. **Quart**: A variation of the 'Seven-Up' sequence building. 7. **Everything Negative**: No tricks, no hearts, no red king combined. 8. **Goulash**: A special high-scoring final round.",
    Player: "Eight contracts played in sequence: 1. **No Tricks**: Avoid winning any tricks. 2. **No Hearts**: Avoid capturing Heart cards. 3. **No Red King (FelsÃ¶)**: Avoid the King of Hearts (The 'Old Man'). 4. **No Last Trick**: Avoid the 8th trick of the round. 5. **Suta (The Train)**: Players must shed cards by building sequences. First to finish wins. 6. **Quart**: A variation of the 'Seven-Up' sequence building. 7. **Everything Negative**: No tricks, no hearts, no red king combined. 8. **Goulash**: A special high-scoring final round.",
    objective: 'Score the fewest penalty points (or most chips) across the full rotation of contracts.',
